<concept id="ID-00000045" xml:lang="en-US"><title>Personalize invitations to connect</title><prolog><critdates><revised modified="" expiry=""/></critdates><permissions view=""/><change-historylist><change-item><change-organization/><change-request-reference><change-request-id/></change-request-reference><change-completed/><change-summary/></change-item></change-historylist><metadata><audience type="" job="" name="NAME"/><contentType>HC</contentType><helpCenter>LinkedIn HC</helpCenter><userJourney/><systemUsage/><billing/><informational/><integrations/><hc_tasks/><hcDeliveryChannel>Help Center</hcDeliveryChannel><trust/><keywords><keyword/></keywords><prodinfo><prodname/><LoB/><feature>Invitations, Networking</feature><platform/><subscriptionLevel/><internalKeyword>Build your network</internalKeyword></prodinfo></metadata></prolog><conbody><p>When inviting members to connect, you can add a personalized message for up to three of the connection requests that you send each month, each with a character limit of 200.</p><note type="important"><p>With a <xref href="https://premium.linkedin.com/" scope="external" format="html">LinkedIn Premium membership</xref>, you have no limit on the number of personalized messages you can add to the connection requests you send.</p></note></conbody></concept>
